{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Le Kiosque","Paris, un kiosque à journaux. Alexandra est réalisatrice, fille, petite-fille et arrière-petite-fille de kiosquiers. Elle est venue prêter main-forte à sa mère et, comme dans un vieux rêve d’enfant, joue à la marchande. Depuis cette fenêtre sur la rue, elle filme avec humour et tendresse les coulisses du métier et le défilé quotidien de clients détonants. Mais la presse papier et les commerces de proximité sont en crise, et ce petit jeu s’avère finalement plus compliqué que prévu...",[4,5,6],"self-employment","disappearing professions","urban",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":42,"tags":3},"Film","FR2021_080","fr2021-080-le-kiosque",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2021-10-06",2021,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Alexandra Pianelli","alexandra-pianelli",0,"Female identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Documentary – Observational mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://fr.web.img4.acsta.net/pictures/21/01/19/16/44/0423220.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLdceLJHPzo",{"native":2,"english":12},[34],{"country":24,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
